<b>H E L P

<c>[Dialog]
<c>->  [F1·Help]

Press F1 to open the Help window.
When the Help window is opened from another window, the help page for that
window is selected.

Use ArrowUp and ArrowDown to select another help-file.
Use ArrowLeft and ArrowRight to move between the pages of the help-file
(Filepages).

<b>Help-files

Help-files are plain text files put in GoatPlayer's 'help' subdirectory.
Line length is 80 chars. File content is printed 30 lines / page.

A few "tags" are used to set line's colors and fontstyle:
<b>·  <b> bold
<i>·  <i> italic
<c>·  <c> colored
